        "t": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our original location, Riverview Marine, opened in Spring Valley, Illinois in 1992. In 2009 we relocated to Ottawa, moved into a larger facility next to Heritage Harbor Marina and became Quest Watersports.</p><p>In 2011 we launched Quest Express Boat Club, the first program of its kind in Illinois, and added Hobie Kayaks and a premium paddlesports rental program.</p>"
